                      "content": "one screenshot and its caption — viewport/theme · W×H. A plain image carrying its own width and height so the ratio is reserved before the bytes arrive; never upscaled, never cropped. Opens the raw PNG at 1:1, and carries the report's two Storybook links for its own theme — both target=_blank, so following one never costs the page being read. dev Storybook is offered only where one is running.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
