                      "content": "Desktop: floating overlay — both blink and slider overlay open it; modes baseline · candidate · diff · blink · slider · actual size; divider + scrubber in slider mode; esc closes, ← → moves. Mobile: renders as a full-screen bottom sheet (same dialog role) — controls drop to a thumb bar, actual size yields to native pinch. compare to: before · design (a SegmentedControl) swaps the modes for a design board in a PanZoom, beside the after screenshot — reference, never a verdict.",
